---
title: "A Plain Deck"
subtitle: "Slides on the native engine"
format: deck
---

## What decks are

A deck renders to HTML slides on Taliesin's own engine, one slide per `##`
heading. No reveal.js, no extension required.

- one point
- another point

## Fragments

A bullet list can reveal one item at a time.

::: {.fragment}
And a whole block can be revealed as an aside.
:::

## Code on a slide

```python
def double(x):
    return x * 2
```

## Speaker notes

The audience sees the slide; only the presenter sees the notes.

::: {.notes}
This is a speaker note, hidden from the audience view.
:::
